ifications</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#C792EA\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C3E88D\">A drawer can slide in from any edge.</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">  ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">VyButton</span><span style=\"color:#C792EA\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C3E88D\">neutral</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C792EA\"> variant</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C3E88D\">soft</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C792EA\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C3E88D\">Open from the right</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">template</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\"> #</span><span style=\"color:#C792EA\">content</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">view</span><span style=\"color:#C792EA\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C3E88D\">flex-1 p-4</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">text</span><span style=\"color:#C792EA\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">=</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#C3E88D\">text-sm text-neutral-600</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">          Use </span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\"> (or the </span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">side</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\"> alias) to pick</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">top</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">right</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">bottom</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">, or</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">left</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">code</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#BABED8\">.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">text</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">view</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">template</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">VyDrawer</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#F07178\">template</span><span style=\"color:#89DDFF\">></span></span></code></pre>"}